// Cabinet 2, Stage 1: Cloudline (docs/cabinets/2-vertical-shooter.md).
// About 3:20: 24 px/s, then 28 px/s from 2:00. `at` is the scroll position
// in pixels; comments give the time at normal speed.
//
// Enemies (for #14): `pos` is where an enemy appears when the scroll reaches
// `at`. Ground targets (crawler, silo, riser, flak) then move down with the
// ground at the scroll speed, exactly as `scenery:` pieces with depth 1.0
// do, so they stay on their mesas and roads. Formation sizes come from
// tuning unless a `size` param is given; `drop` names the Power-up.
//
// Scenery (`scenery:<sprite>`, see src/kit/scenery.rs) is drawn under the
// action: far cloud banks at depth 0.35, the cloud sea and mesas with the
// ground.
